trix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4t \\\\ 10t \\\\ -t\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4+4t \\\\ -2+10t \\\\ 4-t\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nTo get the equations for the line segment, we take only $t\\in [0,1].$ Notice that substitution of $t=0$ in the above equation gives the coordinates of $P$ and substitution of $t=1$ gives the coordinates of $Q.$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ are the following:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-4+4t \\\\ y &=-2+10t \\\\ z &=4-t\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,\\,t\\in [0,1]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290482 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ac3f9aab-3152-5789-9b75-45465330c9b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1+6t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289175}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186289175} :answer-field/id #uuid "79f3f82b-e3c1-563c-b4fb-37687b167006" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289996} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "674073a1-fbab-5222-bf46-b59fe44ed4c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4-10t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288756}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186288756} :answer-field/id #uuid "cfd6442f-e3f1-54b6-92e9-601482f0032e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290185} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f48ba25-e223-5b4d-8f4f-b2f2b89107b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288805}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186288805} :answer-field/id #uuid "e9fad9b7-945f-503b-a42a-3a203bd84adc" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592